text:
@OnlyFitStuff-pj2zf "An artist is a person who uses conscious skill, creative imagination, and imagination to produce works of aesthetic or expressive value."
AI is not conscious, nor does it require the skill of the one writing the prompt. AI also does not have imagination, nor can it truly express any emotions.
AI is a tool, and anyone can and should enjoy its products if it is enjoyable, but in no way shape or form should anything or anyone be given credit for their talent when its majority AI.

@adept.ofiszjalI understand what you’re saying. I’m making a simpler point. When a caveman used the blood of animal to illustrate the animal on a cave wall, that was art too. Using the tools you have to express your interpretation of reality. I’m not making a comparison of what is better or worse because that’s opinion based. 

I wanted to encourage the channel creator because even though it’s not “pure” jazz, I still fucks with it when I’m working. 

Also we should not be afraid, that’s silly.
